          <li>Design modern AWS architectures with Terraform, Lambda, API Gateway, CloudFront, and DynamoDB, and automate their delivery via GitHub Actions.</li>
          <li>Author knowledge bases, technical blogs, and documentation that upskill teams and shrink future ticket volume.</li>
        </ul>
